      "doctor_question": "Hi, it’s good to meet you. What brings you in today?",
      "targeted_symptom": "S022",
      "patient_response": "Well, it's real good to meet you too, Doctor. Thank you for fitting me in, I know you folks are awfully busy. \n\nUm... well, my family actually brought me in today. It was, I guess, just a bit of a misunderstanding down at the agricultural fair. I don't want you to think I'm a troublemaker or anything, I promise I'm not. I was giving my talk, and... well, I got a little carried away and climbed up onto the tractor. I just wanted to show the crowd this, uh, this 'new pattern' I'd been working on. So I was jerking the controls around a bit to demonstrate. \n\nPeople started yelling for me to get down, and... well, I'm a little embarrassed to admit it, but I just couldn't make myself stop doing it. Even with all the hollering. It sounds foolish now, I know. I hope I'm explaining that okay for you? I just want to make sure I'm giving you the right information.",
